      "message": "feat(ui): list the user's machines first on the Setup page\n\nThe Machine page's \"Library\" list now reads the Machines pane's\ncatalogue. It shows the machines in the user machines folder first,\nthen a separator, then the shipped machines. A user machine shows its\nname and file name. A refused file shows its first refusal and cannot\nbe selected. A file selection queues the undoable UseCatalogueMachine.\n\"Load other\" opens in the user machines folder when it exists.\n\nThe test shell sets no user machines folder, so no UI test reads the\ntester's real folder.\n\nFixes #2358\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
